{
  "conversation_lines": [
    {
      "turn_number": 1,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:08:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Hello, Mr. ___. I'm Dr. ___, one of your hospital doctors. I understand you came in because of leaking around your nephrostomy tube?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 2,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:09:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yes, exactly. Since they replaced the tube last time I was here, it’s been leaking through the bandage. It soaks right through."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 3,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:10:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I see. You were here about a week ago for the foot infection and the tube was replaced then?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 4,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:11:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Right. They changed it during that stay. It seemed fine at first, but then the leaking started a couple days later."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 5,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:12:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Okay, thank you. We’ll take a look. Any fever, chills, or pain in your side?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 6,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:13:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "No fever. But I do have that usual flank discomfort when I take a deep breath. Nothing worse than normal."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 7,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:14:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Got it. And how’s your energy? You mentioned in the ED your thinking has felt a bit foggy?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 8,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:15:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yeah, it’s been kind of cloudy. Ever since my nephrologist said I might need dialysis soon. I’ve been stressed."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 9,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:16:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That’s understandable. We’ll check your labs to see if there’s anything going on with your kidneys that could be affecting your thinking."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 10,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:17:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay, thanks. And my foot — it’s not infected anymore, right? I finished the antibiotic."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 11,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:18:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your left foot looks clean, no redness or swelling. You’ve completed the linezolid, so we won’t continue that."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 12,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:19:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Good. I was worried about that."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 13,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:20:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll get some urine and blood tests tonight. Your creatinine is 3.7, which is close to your baseline, so no acute kidney injury."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 14,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:21:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That’s normal for me. But I haven’t seen my kidney doctor in months. Missed appointments because of all these hospital stays."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 15,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:22:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ve already called nephrology. They’ll see you tomorrow and help with next steps, including dialysis planning."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 16,
      "time": "2145-05-18 22:23:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thank you. That helps."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 17,
      "time": "2145-05-19 08:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good morning. Your urine culture came back — it shows E. coli, but you’re not having symptoms like burning or urgency."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 18,
      "time": "2145-05-19 08:16:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "No, my urine seems fine. Does that mean I need antibiotics?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 19,
      "time": "2145-05-19 08:17:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Not right now. Since you’re not symptomatic, treating it could lead to resistance. We’ll monitor it."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 20,
      "time": "2145-05-19 08:18:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 21,
      "time": "2145-05-19 08:19:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your blood work also shows mild acidosis — low bicarbonate. This is common in advanced kidney disease."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 22,
      "time": "2145-05-19 08:20:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Is that what’s making my head feel foggy?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 23,
      "time": "2145-05-19 08:21:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Possibly. We call it toxic metabolic encephalopathy — a fancy way of saying kidney changes can affect brain clarity. It should improve."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 24,
      "time": "2145-05-19 08:22:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Will the sodium bicarbonate help?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 25,
      "time": "2145-05-19 08:23:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Yes. Nephrology is increasing your dose to 1300 mg twice daily to help correct the acidosis."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 26,
      "time": "2145-05-19 08:24:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay, I’ll take it as directed."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 27,
      "time": "2145-05-20 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We reviewed the imaging. There’s a narrowing at the ureteropelvic junction and near the ileostomy. That might be why the tube isn’t staying sealed."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 28,
      "time": "2145-05-20 09:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "So that’s causing the leak?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 29,
      "time": "2145-05-20 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Likely. Interventional radiology will replace the tube tomorrow with one better suited for the anatomy."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 30,
      "time": "2145-05-20 09:03:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Will it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 31,
      "time": "2145-05-20 09:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’ll get light sedation — fentanyl and midazolam — so you’ll be comfortable. The team will use X-ray guidance to place it correctly."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 32,
      "time": "2145-05-20 09:05:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay, I trust them."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 33,
      "time": "2145-05-21 13:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Hi, you just got back from the procedure. They successfully replaced the nephrostomy tube."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 34,
      "time": "2145-05-21 13:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yeah, I barely felt anything. How did it go?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 35,
      "time": "2145-05-21 13:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "They found a stricture at the UPJ and near the ileostomy. The new tube was shortened so it wouldn’t poke out and now it’s seated well."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 36,
      "time": "2145-05-21 13:03:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "And is it still leaking?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 37,
      "time": "2145-05-21 13:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "No, the site is dry. The contrast injection confirmed good positioning and no leakage."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 38,
      "time": "2145-05-21 13:05:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That’s a relief."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 39,
      "time": "2145-05-22 08:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good news — your repeat urine culture shows no growth. The E. coli isn’t growing anymore."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 40,
      "time": "2145-05-22 08:31:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "So it’s gone?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 41,
      "time": "2145-05-22 08:32:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "It’s not growing now, and since you’re not symptomatic, we won’t treat it. We’ll keep monitoring."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 42,
      "time": "2145-05-22 08:33:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay, thanks."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 43,
      "time": "2145-05-23 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your mental clarity is improving. You seem more alert today."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 44,
      "time": "2145-05-23 09:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yeah, I feel sharper. Less foggy."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 45,
      "time": "2145-05-23 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That’s great. Your bicarbonate is up to 20, so the increased dose is helping correct the acidosis."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 46,
      "time": "2145-05-23 09:03:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That’s good to hear."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 47,
      "time": "2145-05-24 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your blood cultures were negative — no bloodstream infection. And your C. diff test was negative too."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 48,
      "time": "2145-05-24 10:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’ve had that before. Glad it’s not back."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 49,
      "time": "2145-05-25 08:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re planning for discharge in a couple days. Your nephrostomy site is dry, labs are stable, and you’re feeling better mentally."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 50,
      "time": "2145-05-25 08:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That’s good. Do I need to come back for anything?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 51,
      "time": "2145-05-25 08:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Yes, you have a nephrology follow-up scheduled. They’ll discuss dialysis options and monitor your kidney function."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 52,
      "time": "2145-05-25 08:03:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay, I’ll make sure to go."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 53,
      "time": "2145-05-26 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your latest creatinine is 3.5 — still stable. And your CBC shows mild anemia, but that’s chronic for you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 54,
      "time": "2145-05-26 09:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’ve had that for years. Just need to keep taking iron."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 55,
      "time": "2145-05-27 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re finalizing your discharge plan. You’ll go home tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 56,
      "time": "2145-05-27 10:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Great. What meds will I be on?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 57,
      "time": "2145-05-27 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Same as before, except sodium bicarbonate is now 1300 mg twice daily. Continue Keppra and tizanidine for seizures and spasms."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 58,
      "time": "2145-05-27 10:03:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "And pain meds?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 59,
      "time": "2145-05-27 10:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Yes, continue OxyContin and Percocet as needed. Watch for constipation — keep using docusate and senna."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 60,
      "time": "2145-05-27 10:05:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Got it."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 61,
      "time": "2145-05-28 11:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Final check — your nephrostomy site is dry, no signs of infection. You’re ready for discharge."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 62,
      "time": "2145-05-28 11:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That’s a relief. No more leaking?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 63,
      "time": "2145-05-28 11:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "None seen since the tube was replaced. Keep the site clean and dry, and call if it starts leaking again."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 64,
      "time": "2145-05-28 11:03:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Will do."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 65,
      "time": "2145-05-28 11:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You have nephrology in one week. They’ll help you prepare for dialysis when the time comes."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 66,
      "time": "2145-05-28 11:05:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’m nervous about that, but I know it’s coming."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 67,
      "time": "2145-05-28 11:06:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "They’ll guide you through it. You’re not alone in this."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 68,
      "time": "2145-05-28 11:07:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thank you, doctor. I appreciate everything."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 69,
      "time": "2145-05-28 11:08:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re welcome. Take care, and we’ll see you in clinic."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 70,
      "time": "2145-05-29 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Just confirming — you’re being discharged home today. Your condition is stable."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 71,
      "time": "2145-05-29 09:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yes, I’m ready to go home."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 72,
      "time": "2145-05-29 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Nursing will go over your discharge instructions and medications one more time."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 73,
      "time": "2145-05-29 09:03:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay, thanks."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 74,
      "time": "2145-05-29 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "One last thing — your mental status is much better. The encephalopathy has improved."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 75,
      "time": "2145-05-29 10:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I feel like myself again. Thanks for figuring it out."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 76,
      "time": "2145-05-29 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re glad. Take care, Mr. ___."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 77,
      "time": "2145-05-29 15:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The discharge papers are ready. You’re cleared to go home."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 78,
      "time": "2145-05-29 15:01:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thank you, doctor. I’ll follow up as scheduled."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 79,
      "time": "2145-05-29 15:02:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Perfect. Take care and stay well."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 80,
      "time": "2145-05-29 15:03:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I will."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 81,
      "time": "2145-05-29 15:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Have a safe trip home."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 82,
      "time": "2145-05-29 15:05:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thanks again."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 83,
      "time": "2145-05-29 15:06:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You're welcome."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 84,
      "time": "2145-05-29 15:07:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Bye."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 85,
      "time": "2145-05-29 15:08:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "admission_start": "2145-05-18 22:08:00",
    "admission_end": "2145-05-29 15:33:00",
    "summary_paragraph": "Mr. ___ was admitted for evaluation of leaking from his left nephrostomy tube, which began after a recent replacement during a prior hospitalization. He has a complex medical history including T12 paraplegia, chronic kidney disease stage IV, neurogenic bladder, and recurrent urinary infections. Imaging revealed a stricture at the ureteropelvic junction and near the ileostomy anastomosis, contributing to the leakage. The nephrostomy tube was successfully exchanged with a modified stent, resolving the leak. He was found to have asymptomatic bacteriuria with E. coli, which did not require treatment. His chronic metabolic acidosis improved with an increased dose of sodium bicarbonate, and his previously noted toxic metabolic encephalopathy resolved. Nephrology was consulted, and a follow-up appointment was scheduled to discuss future dialysis planning. He remained stable, with no signs of active infection or complications, and was discharged home in improved condition.",
    "problems": [
      "Leaking nephrostomy tube",
      "Chronic kidney disease, Stage IV (severe)",
      "Toxic encephalopathy",
      "Acidosis",
      "Paraplegia",
      "Neurogenic bladder NOS",
      "Recurrent urinary tract infections",
      "Stricture or kinking of ureter",
      "Anemia, unspecified",
      "Epilepsy, unspecified, without mention of intractable epilepsy",
      "Other chronic pain",
      "Anxiety state, unspecified",
      "Insomnia, unspecified"
    ]
  }
}
